+  "title": "Planning a BBQ Party in Dubai: Space, Smoke and Service",
+  "body_markdown": "A BBQ plan starts with where cooking can happen safely and with permission. Check the grill position, smoke, access and serving space before choosing the menu or service duration.\n\nFor the service options, explore [catering services in Dubai](/catering-dubai). Use this guide to prepare the details for your enquiry.\n\n## About this guide\n\nThis guide is published by myCHEF, a provider of private chef and catering services. It compares service formats and practical selection criteria. Individual providers should be assessed through their current proposals, relevant documentation and suitability for your occasion.\n\n## Confirm the grill arrangements\n\nAsk who supplies the grill, fuel, cooking equipment and serving stations. The venue must permit the proposed cooking method, with suitable space and ventilation. For yachts or apartment terraces, obtain the operator’s or building’s confirmation before assuming live grilling is possible.\n\n## Build a balanced BBQ menu\n\nCompare the proteins, vegetarian dishes, salads, breads and sauces as a complete meal. Check whether quantities are per guest or per platter and how food will be replenished. Include children and dietary requirements in the initial count.\n\n## Agree the service duration\n\nLive cooking requires a plan for setup, service and safe clear-down. Ask how long the chef remains, whether waiters manage the table and what happens if the event runs late.\n\n## Questions to ask before confirming\n\nRequest a written menu and scope, confirm the guest count and service hours, and check which staff, equipment and extras are included. Share dietary requirements before approving the menu. Review the payment schedule, change deadlines and cancellation terms, and identify the contact who will coordinate the booking.\n\n## Use your completed brief\n\nIf BBQ catering suits your plans, explore the service details and published options below. Share your date, Dubai location, guest count and preferences so the team can assess availability and prepare a tailored proposal. The written booking confirms the final menu, responsibilities and price.\n\n[Explore BBQ catering](/bbq-catering-dubai) · [Request a proposal](/inquiry)\n",
