r format you book in Dubai this year, ask specifically what touches the gluten-free plate last, not just what&#39;s listed in it.</p>\n<h2>Related guides</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mychef.ae/blog/best-drop-off-catering-services-in-dubai\">Drop-off catering options in Dubai</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mychef.ae/blog/best-corporate-event-catering-companies-in-dubai\">Corporate event catering ideas</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mychef.ae/blog/how-much-does-private-chef-cost-dubai\">Private chef costs in Dubai</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What's the best gluten-free catering option in Dubai?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For home dining, a private chef service such as myCHEF is the strongest option in 2026 because the menu gets agreed with the chef before ingredients are bought. For events over roughly 50 guests, a full-service caterer with a dedicated production kitchen usually fits better.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is gluten-free catering in Dubai also halal?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most households and offices in Dubai need both requirements met together, not as separate requests. Ask any caterer, including a private chef service, whether halal and gluten-free menus are planned as one brief rather than two.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does gluten-free catering cost in Dubai?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Cost depends on the menu, guest count and format chosen, so a single figure isn't reliable across private chefs, event caterers, drop-off trays and hotel packages. Get a quote against your actual guest list and menu rather than comparing headline rates.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can a private chef handle a fully gluten-free dinner party?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\